    <string name="glutton_help">How to play</string>
    <string name="glutton_rules">Drag anywhere to move, release to brake.\n\nAnything smaller than you gets swallowed and sticks to your body. Bites close to your own size (green halo) grow you fastest and show their name.\n\nLedges stop you until you are taller than them; stairs let a small gobbler up. Anything too big to swallow is in the way: go round it. Find your way out of the house, across the suburb and into the city. Your own house is on the menu too, once you are big enough.\n\nRobot vacuums and cars bump you while you are small and knock a few things loose: just eat them back. Once you outgrow them, they are lunch.\n\nVacuum pulls everything in reach and stuns the movers. Chain bites for frenzy.\n\nThree minutes: grow as big as you can. Hungry clock: the clock starts short, and every bite and every hourglass adds time.</string>
    <string name="glutton_drag">Drag to munch</string>
    <string name="glutton_touch">Drag to move your gobbler. The map shows the terraces and the movers.</string>
